bandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>POOH from 2287m to 2219m.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-06T03:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-06T04:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">2219</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Installed BOP jetting tool, washed BOP cavitied with 1450lpm, 8bar, made 5 passes. Function tested BOP and washed another 5 passes.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-06T04:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-06T05:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">1843</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- cement plug</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>POOH from 2215m to 1843m.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-06T05:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-06T07:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">1843</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Removed PS21 slips and R/U casing pulling equipment</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-06T07:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-06T08:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">1843</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Performed Pre-job Meeting for pulling tubing</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-06T08:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-06T08:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">1843</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Broke swage, R/B stand of drill pipe and changed BX elevator inserts</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-06T08:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-06T13:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">1366</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>POOH with 7in tubing from 1816m to 1366m (38 joints or 450m of tubing), removed clamps and spooled control line. Average pulling speed 7.2 joints/hour, max pulling speed 10 joints/hour.
Cut control line and secured to tubing with clamp on the last joint. Observed fluid spraying out of control line</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-06T13:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-06T14:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">1366</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Performed Pre-job Meeting for engaging spear and R/D casing pulling equipment. Observed fluid spraying out of control line</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-06T14:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-06T14:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">1366</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Crimped control line to stop fluid spraying out. Removed spooler and scaffold shelter from setback area</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-06T14:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-06T15:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">1366</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>P/U spear and engaged in 7in tubing. RIH w/ spear below rotary to change slips</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-06T15:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-06T16:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">1366</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>R/D casing equipment and installed PS21 slips. Removed tong from frame in preparation for next operation. Meanwhile change BX elevators out for offline inspection and inspected and greased 10 3/4in grapple</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-06T16:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-06T17:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">1366</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Serviced both PRSs</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-06T17:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-06T17:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">1366</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Cleared rig floor, meanwhile Installed inserts in BX elevators. Doped pipe in derrick</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-06T17:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-06T19:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">2278</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- trip</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>RIH w/ tubing on spear to 2278m. Avg. tripping speed 680 m/hr.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-06T19:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-06T20:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">2359</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- trip</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Washed down from 2247m to 2320m with 560l/min and 6 bar. Did not find hard cement. Decreased flow to 222lt/min 1.2bar and continued to wash down to 2359m</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-06T20:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-06T21:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">2335</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- trip</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>POOH from 2359m to 2335m and circulated bottom up with 1350l/min 53bar and then increased to 2020l/min 109bar. In the end of circulation some loose cement was observed in the shakers along with consolidated clumps of cement. Otherwise mostly clean fluid in returns. 
Meanwhile recalculated BHA figures after discrepancy was found</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-06T21:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-06T22:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">2420</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- trip</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Washed down  from 2335m to 2420m with 560l/min 7,4 bar. Did not encounter hard cemtent. 60m left to go before hitting minimum length of plug (at 2480m). 
When making connections observed back flow from DP indicating heavier fluid in annulus</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-08-06T22:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-08-07T00:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">2398</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- trip</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>POOH from 2420m to 2398m and circulated BTM up with 2020 l/min, 106bar. Reduced flow just before BTM up due to possible cement in returns. After BTM up , increased flow to 2660 l/min and 180bar and continued to circulate. Observed some loose cement in returns on shakers.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity>
